  "goodToKnow": "Glotzen (colloquial, slightly rude) means to gawp or stare: Glotz nicht so! It also means to watch TV mindlessly: in die Glotze schauen; die Glotze is slang for the telly. Gaffers who film accidents are called Gaffer, and filming victims can be punished. Neutral synonyms: starren, anstarren. Glotzaugen are goggle eyes. Regular: glotzte, geglotzt."
